Thank you all for your feedback!!! This is a quality-of-life update, and here are the changes we've made:

- New sounds have been added;

- Added the ability to interact with the radio;

- Moved the flashlight to a more visible location;

- Added additional lighting for the fountain when interacting with it;

- Added subtitles for Morpheus' monologue;

- Added a warning disclaimer at the beginning of the game;

- Fixed materials in the second location that were not loading;

- Improved the cinematography of the second location by adding additional lighting, optimizing rain behavior and other weather aspects, and adding volumetric fog.



We would also like to thank the following people for their feedback: yannickgiard, Niwaka 69 :D, Kenta Kogai.



Every review is important to us, as we strive to create a positive gaming experience for every user!
